            "block_order": null,
            "group_id": 20
        },
        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "If the tolerance is exceeded, the nut should be replaced or, if of the compensating kind, adjusted to take up for wear.",
            "block_bbox": [
                1033,
                1692,
                1814,
                1827
            ],
            "block_id": 21,
            "block_order": null,
            "group_id": 21
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Now that the alignments of the lathe members are finished, the next operation is the assembly of miscellaneous unattached parts. Strictly speaking, this is not scraping work, but it may nonetheless be the responsibility of the operator.",
            "block_bbox": [
                1034,
                1826,
                1831,
                2098
            ],
            "block_id": 22,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 22
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
