        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In assembling the lead screw and apron, one point to watch is the adjustment that may be required between the lead screw bearings and the half nut to accommodate them to each other under the new and changed conditions. Since more or less metal has been scraped from both the bed ways and the carriage slides, it is obvious that the present position of the half nuts",
